==Turkish==

===Suffix===
{{tr-suffix}}

# {{non-gloss definition|Used to form ablative of nouns.}}
#: {{suffixusex|tr|okul|gloss1=school|okuldan|gloss2=from school}}

===Usage notes===
* It's used when the noun's last vowel is a back vowel.
* It could be {{m|tr|-den}}, when the noun's last vowel is a front vowel.
*: {{suffixusex|tr|köy|köyden}}
* It could be {{m|tr|-tan}}, when the noun's last consonant is "f", "s", "t", "k", "ç", "ş", "h" or "p".
*: {{suffixusex|tr|mutfak|mutfaktan}}
* It must be used with an [[apostrophe]] while forming a proper noun.
*: {{suffixusex|tr|İstanbul|İstanbul'dan}}